<title>USA: Ryan's June same-store sales down 1.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Ryan's June same-store sales down 1.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>GREER, S.C. 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1997	 1996	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>June		 $49.2	$46.0	  +7	 -1.8</p>
<p>Quarter	   $157.2     $145.1	  +8	 -1.2</p>
<p>Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>    Month is   four weeks ended	  July 2.</p>
<p>Quarter is second quarter ended July 2.</p>
<p>    Full company name is	Ryan's Family Steak Houses Inc</p>
<p>NOTE: The 1996 second-quarter sales figures exclude $1.86 million in revenues of non-Ryan Family Steak House restaurants the company no longer operates.</p>
</text>
